              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibakalusia nibamureeba bari Niheena, Omwami? Nabasunjila ari Ewa omulambo kuli, ebweneyo niyo ewa tsingosia tsilakhung'aanila.",
